cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "dRNA Methylation Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A Snakemake workflow for Oxford Nanopore direct RNA sequencing (dRNA-seq):
  Dorado basecalling with RNA modification models, minimap2 alignment to genome
  and/or transcriptome, Modkit modification pileup, bedMethyl filtering, and
  aggregate QC (NanoPlot and MultiQC).
type: software
